OL,3,AUK says Brexit reset deal 'done' but
OL,4,Atalks to continue in some areas after
OL,5,AEU tuition fees demand
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe youth mobility scheme is expected
OL,8,Fto allow 100,000 young people from the
OL,9,FEU to travel, work and study in the UK
OL,10,Fper year - the same number of young
OL,11,FBritons would be allowed into Europe
OL,13,FSpeaking to the BBC earlier, Reform's
OL,14,FNigel Farage - a prominent Brexit
OL,15,Fcampaigner - said the PM has no
OL,16,F"democratic mandate to do any of this"
OL,17,F- here's what other political leaders
OL,18,Fare saying
